#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:104
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_SeashoreHouseIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm the owner of the SEASHORE HOUSE.\n"
"But you can call me MR. SEA!\p"
"What I love above all is to see hot\n"
"POKéMON battles.\p"
"Let me see that your heart burns hot!\p"
"If you can defeat all the TRAINERS\n"
"here, I'll reward your efforts.$"
msgstr ""
"我是海之家的老板。\n"
"不过你可以叫我大海先生！\p"
"我最喜欢的就是看火热的宝可梦对战。\p"
"让我看看你那颗火热的心吧！\p"
"如果你能打败这里所有的训练家，\n"
"我就奖励你的努力。$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:113
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_ShowMeSomeHotMatches"
msgid ""
"Show me some hot matches!\p"
"I run this SEASHORE HOUSE just for\n"
"that reason alone!$"
msgstr ""
"让我看看火热的对战吧！\p"
"我经营这家海之家就是为了这个！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:118
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_TakeTheseSodaPopBottles"
msgid ""
"You're scorching hot!\n"
"Those battles blazed!\l"
"I'm more than just satisfied!\p"
"As thanks for showing me your hot\n"
"streak, I want you to take these.\p"
"It's half a dozen bottles of SODA POP!$"
msgstr ""
"你真是太火热了！\n"
"那些对战简直在燃烧！我心满意足了！\p"
"为了感谢你让我看到你火热的表现，\n"
"请收下这些吧。\p"
"这是半打劲爽汽水！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:126
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_BagFull"
msgid ""
"Oh, but hey, your BAG's jammed full.\n"
"I'll hang on to these for you.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，不过你的包包已经塞满了。\n"
"我先帮你保管着吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:130
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_WantToBuySodaPop"
msgid ""
"Want to buy some SODA POP?\n"
"POKéMON love it!\p"
"Just ¥300 a bottle!\n"
"Buy some!$"
msgstr ""
"要不要买些劲爽汽水？宝可梦最喜欢了！\p"
"一瓶只要300元！买一些吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:136
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_HereYouGo"
msgid "Here you go!$"
msgstr "给你！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:139
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_NotEnoughMoney"
msgid "You don't have the money.$"
msgstr "你的钱不够哦。$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:142
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_ThatsTooBad"
msgid ""
"No?\n"
"That's too bad.$"
msgstr "不要吗？真可惜。$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:146
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_DwayneIntro"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for a battle in the\n"
"SEASHORE HOUSE, you'll find no\l"
"hotter TRAINER than me, matey!$"
msgstr ""
"如果你想在海之家找人对战，那就\n"
"没有比我更火热的训练家了，伙计！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:151
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_DwayneDefeated"
msgid ""
"That was a hot battle!\n"
"I can accept that loss, matey!$"
msgstr ""
"真是一场火热的对战！\n"
"这场失败我心服口服，伙计！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:155
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_DwaynePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Whenever I'm in SLATEPORT, I enjoy\n"
"hot battles and ice-cold SODA POP!$"
msgstr ""
"每次来凯那市，我都会享受火热的\n"
"对战和冰凉的劲爽汽水！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:159
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_JohannaIntro"
msgid ""
"Boring battles aren't worth the effort.\p"
"Fiery hot battles are what toughen up\n"
"TRAINERS and POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"无聊的对战根本不值得费力气。\p"
"只有火热的对战才能让训练家和\n"
"宝可梦变得更强！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:164
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_JohannaDefeated"
msgid "That's hot!$"
msgstr "真火热！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:167
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_JohannaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Whew, I'm all thirsty.\n"
"Maybe I'll have a SODA POP.$"
msgstr "呼，我好渴啊。来瓶劲爽汽水吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:171
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_SimonIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm going to show you how great\n"
"my POKéMON are, but don't cry!$"
msgstr ""
"我要让你看看我的宝可梦有多厉害，\n"
"你可别哭哦！$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:175
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_SimonDefeated"
msgid "…I lost, but I won't cry…$"
msgstr "……我输了，但我不会哭的……$"

#: data/maps/Route109_SeashoreHouse/scripts.inc:178
msgctxt "Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_SimonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If one of my POKéMON knew the move\n"
"for carrying me across water on its\l"
"back, I could get rid of this inner tube.$"
msgstr ""
"要是我的宝可梦会把我背过水面的招式，\n"
"我就可以扔掉这个游泳圈了。$"
